UID:door-ruling-e@weird.baby
DTSTAMP:20260919T100904Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260919T100904Z
SEQUENCE:29830209
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
SUMMARY:✓ FIRST: post "We open 10/31"\, close robots\; program "We are o
 pen!" for 10-31
DESCRIPTION:OPS · DONE\n\n1. Mike\, 09-18: TODAY post "We open 10/31" an
 d close robots. On 10/31 post "We are open!" with nothing needed from h
 im then. The site's official birthday is 10/31 in lore. Ops decides wha
 t is manual and what is programmed.\n2. Ops' split: PROGRAMMED by the s
 ite's own clock: the robots wing shut until Sat 10-31 00:00 New York an
 d open after\; the lobby line reading "We open 10/31" before that momen
 t and "We are open!" after. PROGRAMMED through Buffer: "We are open!" q
 ueued for 10-31 on the three channels. MANUAL\, once: the deploy (Mike'
 s one command)\; the "We open 10/31" post on the channels (the queue's 
 first live send: as a draft first\, then for real\; this one announceme
 nt is his exception to 'nothing posts before the door').\n3. Read docs/
 canonical/OPERATIONS.md\, src/data/artists/record-epoch.js and src/lib/
 wing-open.js first. Moving RECORD_EPOCH is the designed fix\, but day o
 ne becomes a SATURDAY (reveal/week-one.mjs and week-two.mjs rows are MO
 N..FRI\; tools/arc.mjs is right only while day one is a Monday) and the
  Record day turns at 17:00 (his 08-17 ruling) while the door is midnigh
 t. Smallest change\; every gate (lint baseline\, provenance:gate\, reve
 al:check\, parity:gate\, instory:gate\, shellstop:gate)\; build:launch\
 ; look as-of 10-30 and 10-31\; hand Mike the deploy. Do not run record:
 land or day:proof.\n4. Lore: the birthday is 10/31. The guest book's en
 try 07 ("My birthday\, I guess! Weird.Baby is open for business!") and 
 any page that states a birthday or an opening are checked against it\; 
 his words are flagged\, never edited.\n\nThe Days: https://claude.ai/co
 de/artifact/207ed53f-1abf-4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
CATEGORIES:Weird.Baby Ops
STATUS:COMPLETED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
